  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.849, "end": 4.529, "lines": ["The researchers had this advice","for veterinarians."]},
    {"start": 4.529, "end": 9.249, "lines": ["I think for veterinarians, this study,","combined with the other studies or reports"]},
    {"start": 9.249, "end": 13.409, "lines": ["of outbreaks in veterinary facilities,","just really support that veterinarians"]},
    {"start": 13.409, "end": 15.409, "lines": ["need to be aware of this issue."]},
    {"start": 15.409, "end": 21.409, "lines": ["I think a lot of patients, or rather,","in the veterinary context, clients"]},
    {"start": 21.409, "end": 25.889, "lines": ["of our animal patients are looking","to veterinarians to make sure"]},
    {"start": 25.889, "end": 30.016, "lines": ["that they are. Warning them or making","them aware of any health risks that they"]},
    {"start": 30.016, "end": 32.576, "lines": ["might have from their pet.","And so I think the first"]},
    {"start": 32.576, "end": 34.336, "lines": ["thing is to really raise awareness"]},
    {"start": 34.336, "end": 39.136, "lines": ["that this is a potential zoonotic risk.","But then I think there's some other"]},
    {"start": 39.136, "end": 43.296, "lines": ["implications for how we practice","veterinary medicine in terms of really"]},
    {"start": 43.296, "end": 48.016, "lines": ["increasing our infection prevention","and control so that we limit that spread"]},
    {"start": 48.016, "end": 52.736, "lines": ["within hospitals, we limit acquisition","by animals, and we limit the number"]},
    {"start": 52.736, "end": 56.56, "lines": ["of animals that go out into the community","and possibly, you know."]},
    {"start": 56.832, "end": 59.552, "lines": ["Shed this into the environment","or spread it onward."]},
    {"start": 59.552, "end": 62.112, "lines": ["So that's what we're really trying","to prevent here."]},
    {"start": 62.112, "end": 66.192, "lines": ["And so I think the first step is really","education and making veterinarians aware"]},
    {"start": 66.192, "end": 67.392, "lines": ["of this issue."]},
    {"start": 67.392, "end": 71.872, "lines": ["To the authors, this study raises a lot","of questions for future research."]},
    {"start": 71.872, "end": 73.432, "lines": ["I view this as."]},
    {"start": 73.728, "end": 76.048, "lines": ["Kind of a wide open area for research."]},
    {"start": 76.048, "end": 81.648, "lines": ["We have a lot of knowledge gaps related","to CPCRE in animals, and we have some"]},
    {"start": 81.648, "end": 84.928, "lines": ["related to CPCRE exchange","between humans and animals."]},
    {"start": 84.928, "end": 89.488, "lines": ["And I think that there's just","so much work to be done that I don't know"]},
    {"start": 89.488, "end": 91.528, "lines": ["where to start except for."]},
    {"start": 91.904, "end": 94.944, "lines": ["I think frequency","and directionality of transmission"]},
    {"start": 94.944, "end": 98.784, "lines": ["between humans and animals","is going to be a major question."]},
    {"start": 98.784, "end": 102.064, "lines": ["So, for example,","what is the risk to a household member"]},
    {"start": 102.064, "end": 105.584, "lines": ["when a pet in a house is found","to be colonized or infected with CPCRE?"]},
    {"start": 105.584, "end": 107.344, "lines": ["What do we tell that person?"]},
    {"start": 107.344, "end": 110.384, "lines": ["That's an open-ended question right now.","We don't know."]},
    {"start": 110.384, "end": 116.104, "lines": ["What do we tell a pet owner","when their pet acquires CPCRE?"]},
    {"start": 116.464, "end": 120.544, "lines": ["What can we tell them about preventing","transmission onward into the community?"]},
    {"start": 120.544, "end": 125.424, "lines": ["Do they need to avoid public","areas like dog parks or groomers"]},
    {"start": 125.424, "end": 126.944, "lines": ["or anything like that?"]},
    {"start": 126.944, "end": 129.184, "lines": ["How long will they be colonized?"]},
    {"start": 129.184, "end": 130.584, "lines": ["We don't know"]},
    {"start": 131.024, "end": 132.704, "lines": ["that answer either."]},
    {"start": 132.704, "end": 135.504, "lines": ["And so coming","up with these recommendations is very"]},
    {"start": 135.504, "end": 139.824, "lines": ["difficult when we don't have sort","of the basic knowledge of transmission"]},
    {"start": 139.824, "end": 142.024, "lines": ["between humans and animals."]},
    {"start": 143.93, "end": 144.97, "lines": ["Another question that I"]},
    {"start": 144.97, "end": 149.45, "lines": ["think is relevant to the human health side","as well is the overall burden of CPCRE"]},
    {"start": 149.45, "end": 150.57, "lines": ["in companion animals."]},
    {"start": 150.57, "end": 152.65, "lines": ["How many animals out there are colonized"]},
    {"start": 152.65, "end": 157.29, "lines": ["that we're not going to detect","because they have no indication to test?"]},
    {"start": 157.29, "end": 161.61, "lines": ["But I think that that question is also","not well characterized in humans."]},
    {"start": 161.61, "end": 165.13, "lines": ["So those are the kinds","of things that I'm thinking of related"]},
    {"start": 165.13, "end": 166.73, "lines": ["to how do we stop this?"]},
    {"start": 166.73, "end": 171.41, "lines": ["How do we intervene in the transmission","chain to prevent further"]},
    {"start": 172.032, "end": 173.312, "lines": ["Transmission."]},
    {"start": 173.312, "end": 177.472, "lines": ["We just have so many knowledge gaps","that I don't think we have very strong"]},
    {"start": 177.472, "end": 179.178, "lines": ["recommendations at this time."]},
    {"start": 179.472, "end": 182.752, "lines": ["I think there's a big black box as far"]},
    {"start": 182.752, "end": 187.472, "lines": ["as our understanding of colonization,","how long it persists in the animals,"]},
    {"start": 187.472, "end": 191.552, "lines": ["how long it persists in the humans,","what's the ongoing risk?"]},
    {"start": 191.552, "end": 194.592, "lines": ["What's necessarily the risk","of colonization?"]},
    {"start": 194.592, "end": 198.256, "lines": ["Are you constantly spreading?","Was this only a temporary phenomenon?"]},
    {"start": 198.256, "end": 202.376, "lines": ["Does it clear I think there's a lot","of open areas for research"]},
    {"start": 202.816, "end": 208.336, "lines": ["for CPCRE causing healthcare associated","infections in humans or causing community"]},
    {"start": 208.336, "end": 210.27, "lines": ["associated infections in humans."]}
  ]
}
